OL,3,AVeteran Nigerian Nollywood actor Pete  
OL,4,AEdochie dies aged 79                   
OL,6,FIn a statement, his family said Edochie
OL,7,Fdied in the early hours of Wednesday in
OL,8,Fthe south-eastern Nigerian city of     
OL,9,FEnugu following a prolonged battle with
OL,10,Fprostate cancer.                       
OL,12,FTributes are pouring in from fans and  
OL,13,Ffellow actors, remembering him as a    
OL,14,FNollywood legend who helped shape      
OL,15,FNigeria's film industry.               
